wgf-autopilot 1
# One lap, recorded by `wgf autopilot --record` from a driven lap (the inputs below are
# its kind, not the real ones: a real recording is a key or stick change every few
# frames), and what it expects: the race starting, every checkpoint in order, and the
# lap inside its window. Physics with Jolt's cross-platform determinism makes it the
# same natively and in a browser.
seed 1
at 1 expect racer.state == 0
at 240 expect racer.state == 2
at 240 key down up
at 300 stick 0 left -0.35
at 360 stick 0 left 0
at 1800 expect racer.checkpoint >= 4
at 3600 expect racer.lap == 2
at 3600 expect racer.best > 50
at 3600 expect racer.best < 70
at 3610 end
